{
  "description": [
    "ctadl query model for the TaintBench `fakebank_android_samp` app. Sources and sinks",
    "are derived from the framework methods named in the source/sink IR (Jimple)",
    "signatures of fakebank_android_samp_findings.json. Sources: the app's own",
    "BankActivity.findViewById() returns the EditText holding the banking credentials the",
    "user types (inherited from android.app.Activity, but TaintBench names the app class",
    "the call site's receiver is typed as); TelephonyManager.getSimSerialNumber() reads the",
    "SIM serial; SmsMessage.getDisplayMessageBody() reads the intercepted SMS (the mTAN);",
    "File.<init>(String) names the APK the app then installs, so the source is the",
    "constructed File itself, i.e. the receiver Argument(0). Sinks: DefaultHttpClient",
    ".execute() / HttpClient.execute() post to the C2 server, HttpURLConnection",
    ".getInputStream() opens the connection built from the tainted URL (the sink is that",
    "receiver, covered by Argument(*)), and InstallService.startActivity() launches the",
    "package installer on the tainted file.",
    "The `propagation` models summarize the apache-http request plumbing the leaked data",
    "travels through -- BasicNameValuePair, UrlEncodedFormEntity/StringEntity,",
    "HttpPost.<init> and HttpPost.setEntity all forward their argument into the object they",
    "build. None of those classes has a body in the APK, so without a summary the taint stops",
    "before it reaches `execute`. `ctadl index` consumes these (they become function",
    "summaries) and `ctadl query` the sources and sinks; xtask passes this file to both.",
    "The remaining propagations carry the two non-http flows: TextView.getText() and",
    "Editable.toString() read the typed credentials out of the EditText (finding #1), and",
    "Uri.fromFile() / Intent.setDataAndType() put the tainted file into the install Intent",
    "(finding #5).",
    "ctadl ignores the non-schema `description` key, as it does `expected_lines` in the",
    "nightly models."
  ],
  "model_generators": [
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "findViewById",
          "parent": "Lcom/example/bankmanager/BankActivity;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "UserInput",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getSimSerialNumber",
          "parent": "Landroid/telephony/TelephonyManager;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "DeviceData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getDisplayMessageBody",
          "parent": "Landroid/telephony/SmsMessage;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "SmsData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "<init>",
          "parent": "Ljava/io/File;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "FileData",
            "port": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "execute",
          "parent": "Lorg/apache/http/impl/client/DefaultHttpClient;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "execute",
          "parent": "Lorg/apache/http/client/HttpClient;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getInputStream",
          "parent": "Ljava/net/HttpURLConnection;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "startActivity",
          "parent": "Lcom/example/service/InstallService;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "<init>",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/message/BasicNameValuePair;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          },
          {
            "input": "Argument(2)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "<init>",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/entity/UrlEncodedFormEntity;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/entity/StringEntity;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpPost;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpGet;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "setEntity",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpPost;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpEntityEnclosingRequestBase;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/HttpEntityEnclosingRequest;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getText",
          "parents": [
            "Landroid/widget/TextView;",
            "Landroid/widget/EditText;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(0)",
            "output": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "toString",
          "parents": [
            "Landroid/text/Editable;",
            "Ljava/lang/CharSequence;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(0)",
            "output": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "fromFile",
          "parents": [
            "Landroid/net/Uri;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(*)",
            "output": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "names": [
            "setDataAndType",
            "setData",
            "putExtra"
          ],
          "parents": [
            "Landroid/content/Intent;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          },
          {
            "input": "Argument(2)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
